## What was implemented

- `apps/api/src/domain/agent/tool-call-audit.ts` — `classifyToolNamespace` (builtin
  `graph.`/`brain.` vs `mcp:<server>.<tool>`, reusing F52's `isReservedToolFullName` /
  `parseMcpToolFullName`), `recordToolCall` (tool-call four elements + I-44 hard precondition:
  audit write failure throws `ProvenanceWriteFailedError`, no success value is ever returned).
- `apps/api/src/domain/agent/call-chain.ts` — `recordCallChainHop`: depth cap (O-36 = 2, read
  from `thresholds.ts`, not hardcoded), depth-3 termination with trace (I-46), callee permission
  evaluated independently via F56's `intersectAgentPermission` with no `callerPermission`
  parameter accepted at all (I-47 structural guarantee), pause-for-approval vs auto-approve
  (`已暂停` / `人已批准`), `AGENT_DISABLED` / `EFFECTIVE_PERMISSION_DENIED` /
  `CALL_DEPTH_EXCEEDED` / `PROVENANCE_WRITE_FAILED` error paths all write an audit trace before
  throwing.
- `apps/api/src/domain/agent/anomaly-detection.ts` — `detectQuotaAnomaly` (relative-to-baseline
  10x/24h judgment, O-36, division-by-zero guarded), `raiseQuotaAnomaly` (auto rate limit +
  `visibleToSubject: true`), `interceptUnauthorizedCall` (intercept + count, not just log),
  `markAnomalyNormal` (reason required).
- `packages/contracts/src/thresholds.ts` — added `agentQuotaAnomalyMultiplier` (10),
  `agentQuotaAnomalyWindowHours` (24), `agentCallChainMaxDepth` (2) as `known: true` resolved
  thresholds, sourced to the already-decided O-36 items 3/4 in
  `requirements/04-agent/uc-4-4-agent-行为审计.md`.
- Test files (39 new tests across 4 files + 1 shared fixture) under
  `apps/api/tests/capability/agent/`.

